      "text": "Explanation:\nrotate 1 steps to the right: [7,1,2,3,4,5,6]\nrotate 2 steps to the right: [6,7,1,2,3,4,5]\nrotate 3 steps to the right: [5,6,7,1,2,3,4]\n",
