      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Write a function that reverses a string. The input string is given as an array of characters s.\n\nYou must do this by modifying the input array in-place with O(1) extra memory.",
      "fontSize": 30.111258865248256,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Write a function that reverses a string. The input string is given as an array of characters s.\n\nYou must do this by modifying the input array in-place with O(1) extra memory.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "reyWM2tbU6bsSKU5HpkLJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12165.240635925504,
      "y": -376.4185149232467,
