      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You are given an array of integers nums, there is a sliding window of size k which is \nmoving from the very left of the array to the very right. You can only see the k \nnumbers in the window. Each time the sliding window moves right by one position.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
