    },
    {
      "id": "68yoYEIb0YzRdO1Eh6Hk9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4892.626052523548,
      "y": 3605.5160280664904,
      "width": 1339.45166015625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2lb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1228362606,
      "version": 479,
      "versionNonce": 2124355374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758847248892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.- Cualquier nodo puede ser rojo o negro excepto el root y los nodos vacios",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.- Cualquier nodo puede ser rojo o negro excepto el root y los nodos vacios",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nG7TGZkjiGfqy5JLfQ7_z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4891.061422826155,
      "y": 3684.5917375934196,
      "width": 866.6996459960938,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2lc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 437695918,
      "version": 496,
      "versionNonce": 491782510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758847248892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.- No pueden existir 2 nodos rojos consecutivos",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.- No pueden existir 2 nodos rojos consecutivos",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LBg7_frpZ3EA8gRrybnXm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4892.175939976245,
      "y": 3770.999069251572,
      "width": 1197.79150390625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2ld",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1431293934,
      "version": 460,
      "versionNonce": 48866222,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758847248892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.- La altura \"Black Height\" tiene que ser la misma por todo el arbol ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.- La altura \"Black Height\" tiene que ser la misma por todo el arbol ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YHngrOs0h58Ftc6t8lj-C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4888.630055814367,
      "y": 3857.346367156363,
      "width": 985.5357055664062,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2le",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1995153966,
      "version": 477,
      "versionNonce": 1100283374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758847248892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4.- Nodos vacios y root nodes forzosamente son negros",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.- Nodos vacios y root nodes forzosamente son negros",
